{"ticker":{"symbol":"213500.KS","name":"한솔제지","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":6400.0,"change_pct":0.015873015873015817,"market_cap":152180326400.0,"pe":7.4766355,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.078125,"week52_low":5930.0,"week52_high":9370.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Paper & Paper Products","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":1635,"website":"https://www.hansolpaper.co.kr","business_summary":"Hansol Paper Co., Ltd. produces, distributes, and sells paper products in South Korea and internationally. The company offers graphic papers, such as commercial and premium printing, colored, textured, pearlescent, and fiber-blended; packaging papers, including functional paper and premium packaging, as well as boxboard; and label papers comprising facestock and release liner. It also provides dye sublimation papers consisting of SUBLI-MATE; thermal papers, including non-top coated and top coated; and specialty papers, such as high-gloss paper and flame-retardant wallpapers, as well as biomaterials, including nanocellulose. The company was formerly known as Saehan Paper Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Hansol Paper Co., Ltd. in January 1992. Hansol Paper Co., Ltd. was founded in 1965 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"한솔제지(주)는 국내 및 해외에서 종이 제품을 생산, 유통, 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 상업용 및 고급 인쇄, 유색, 질감, 진주빛 및 섬유 혼합과 같은 그래픽 용지를 제공합니다. 기능성 종이, 고급 포장지, 박스보드 등의 포장지; 및 페이스스톡 및 릴리스 라이너를 포함하는 라벨 용지를 포함한다. 또한 SUBLI-MATE로 구성된 염료승화지를 제공합니다. 비탑 코팅 및 탑 코팅을 포함한 감열지; 고광택지, 난연벽지 등 특수지와 나노셀룰로오스 등 바이오소재 등이 있습니다. 회사의 전신은 새한제지(주)였으며 1992년 1월 한솔제지(주)로 상호를 변경했습니다. 한솔제지(주)는 1965년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":2348800000000.0,"rev_lo":2334600000000.0,"rev_hi":2363000000000.0,"rev_g":0.0829,"n":2,"eps":950.5,"eps_lo":910.0,"eps_hi":991.0,"eps_g":4.8313003},{"period":"2027","rev":2446550000000.0,"rev_lo":2405100000000.0,"rev_hi":2488000000000.0,"rev_g":0.0416,"n":2,"eps":856.0,"eps_lo":725